-s"><dt class="text-caption text-muted">Max output</dt><dd class="flex items-baseline gap-sm"><span class="text-title font-medium text-primary">128K</span><span class="text-caption text-muted">tokens</span></dd></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs px-lg py-md border-t sm:border-s sm:border-t-0"><dt class="text-caption text-muted">Input pricing</dt><dd class="flex items-baseline gap-sm"><span class="text-title font-medium text-primary">From $0.10</span><span class="text-caption text-muted">/ MTok</span></dd></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-xs px-lg py-md border-s border-t sm:border-t-0"><dt class="text-caption text-muted">Output pricing</dt><dd class="flex items-baseline gap-sm"><span class="text-title font-medium text-primary">From $0.50</span><span class="text-caption text-muted">/ MTok</span></dd></div></dl></div></div></header>
<h2 id="overview" class="group">Overview<span class="relative hidden h-[1em] w-0 align-middle lg:inline-block"><span role="status" aria-live="polite" class="sr-only"></span><button type="button" data-cds="Button" data-cds-icon-only="" data-cds-ghost="" data-size="xs" class="cds-reset group/btn isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap select-none cursor-[var(--cds-cursor-interactive)] aria-disabled:cursor-default data-[disabled]:cursor-default border-0 outline-none focus-visible:outline-hidden [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:outline-hidden rounded h-control font-sans text-body [&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-disabled disabled:pointer-events-none transition-shadow duration-fast text-primary font-normal font-control aria-pressed:text-accent focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-initial-focus]:focus]:shadow-focus aspect-square w-control px-0 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:opacity-100 stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:text-button-disabled stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:[--cds-shortcut-cap-ink:currentColor] stacks:[&amp;:disabled:not([aria-busy])]:not-in-data-[cds=SplitDropdownButton]:[--cds-text-button-disabled:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-icon-only-disabled)] absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 data-[copied]:opacity-100 touch:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy link to Overview" id="_R_18ea9av5ul5u9fmbtdid99lb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -z-[1] rounded-[inherit] inset-0 cds-btn-squish stacks:transform-none!"><span data-cds-part="paint" class="absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] transition-[background-color,box-shadow,color] stacks:transition-[box-shadow,color] duration-fast ease-out group-focus-visible/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] group-[[data-initial-focus]:focus]/btn:shadow-[inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--cds-page-bg)] bg-transparent group-hover/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-ghost-hover group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:bg-accent  stacks:group-hover/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-hover/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-[:disabled:not([aria-busy])]/btn:group-[[aria-haspopup][aria-expanded=true]]/btn:bg-transparent stacks:group-hover/btn:group-aria-pressed/btn:layers-1-accent-layer stacks:group-active/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:bg-fill-button-ghost-hover stacks:group-active/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer stacks:group-has-[:active]/btn:layers-1-fill-button-layer "></span></span><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1 "><span data-cds="Icon" style="font-size:calc(1rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1));font-weight:533.3" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button></span></h2>
<div class="prose-block"><p>Claude Haiku 5.5 is built for high-volume, latency-sensitive work such as classification, routing, extraction, and subagent tasks. It supports adaptive thinking with the effort parameter, a 1M token context window, and up to 128k output tokens. It uses the same newer tokenizer as Claude 4.7 and later models, so the same text counts as approximately 30 percent more tokens than on Claude Haiku 4.5. Its thinking blocks work only in the account that produced them, or in an account linked to it.</p><p>For code changes, see the <a href="/docs/en/models/haiku-5-5/migration-guide">migration guide</a>. For model IDs, pricing, and limits, see the <a href="/docs/en/models/haiku-5-5/overview">Claude Haiku 5.5 overview</a>. For prompting guidance, see <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/prompting-claude-haiku-5-5">Prompting Claude Haiku 5.5</a>.</p><p><a class="cds-reset cds-text-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-[0.25em] [--cds-text-link-color:initial] cursor-pointer" data-cds="TextLink" href="/docs/en/models/haiku-5-5/whats-new-haiku-5-5"><span class="cds-text-link-underline">What’s new in Claude Haiku 5.5</span><span data-cds="Icon" data-cds-mirror="" style="font-size:1lh;font-weight:533.3" class="self-center" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></p></div>
